sentences.t:
Infandum, regina, iubes renovare dolorem,
Troianas ut opes et lamentabile regnum
eruerint Danai;

sentences.l:
An unspeakable grief, queen, you bid me renew,
how the Trojan wealth and the lamentable kingdom
the Danaans have overthrown;

Nor did I keep silent, madly, and I myself, if any chance should bring it,
if ever I should return victor to my native Argos,
I promised an avenger, and with words I stirred bitter hatreds.
